pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: $white
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 15, 880, 41]
    content:
      style: $title
      align: [left, middle]
      text: <p>业务页面长出 AI 能力</p>
  - elementId: accent-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [40, 52, 50, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: $accent}
  - elementId: demo-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 310, 400, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: $muted
      align:
        - center
        - middle
      text: 报价工作台 AI 报价助手 Demo
  - elementId: mode-a-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [490, 65, 430, 120]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: $light
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: $border
  - elementId: mode-a-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [505, 72, 150, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: $muted
      align:
        - left
        - middle
      text: 模式 A（常规）
  - elementId: mode-a-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [505, 94, 400, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: $primary
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: AI → 页面
  - elementId: mode-a-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [505, 122, 400, 58]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>AI 结合 CLI、接口、Skills、工作流等后端能力</p>
        <p>替代页面功能（创建报价、解析 Excel、批量调价）</p>
        <p>处理完成后把结果展示给用户</p>
  - elementId: mode-b-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [490, 200, 430, 120]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFF7ED"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "#FED7AA"
  - elementId: mode-b-badge
    elementType: text
    bounds: [800, 205, 105, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: $accent
      bold: true
      align:
        - right
        - middle
      text: NEW
  - elementId: mode-b-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [505, 207, 150, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: $muted
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 模式 B（本次）
  - elementId: mode-b-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [505, 229, 400, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: $primary
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 页面 → AI
  - elementId: mode-b-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [505, 257, 400, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>业务页面通过 JSBridge 主动调用 AI</p>
        <p>chat.sendMessage · fillComposer · togglePanel</p>
        <p>页面主动推，AI 被动响应</p>
  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [40, 345, 880, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: $border
  - elementId: bottom-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 358, 880, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: $text
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align:
        - center
        - top
      text: |
        <p>两种模式<strong>互补</strong>：模式 A 用 AI 替代页面功能，模式 B 让页面主动调 AI</p>
        <p>JSBridge 解决的是"业务方不想等用户开口，想主动推给 AI"的场景</p>
  - elementId: KPsCij
    elementType: image
    bounds: [40, 85.1, 430, 209.9]
    src: https://kimi-img.moonshot.cn/pub/slides/26-08-20-20:05:45-da3er6ed44j4g8326t8g.png
    fit:
      mode: fill
